WEBVTT

00:14.950 --> 00:21.910
Every epoch dreams its successor.
Jules Michelet

00:28.920 --> 00:33.210
Producers
Masao Maruyama Iwao Yamaki

00:34.420 --> 00:38.220
Based on the Comic by
Osamu Tezuka

00:39.430 --> 00:43.270
Screenplay by
Katsuhiro Otomo

00:44.430 --> 00:48.230
Character Design/Animation Supervisor
Yasuhiro Nakura

00:49.440 --> 00:53.230
CG/Art Director
Shuichi Hirata

00:54.480 --> 00:58.320
CG Technical Director
Tsuneo Maeda

00:59.490 --> 01:03.280
Music
Toshiyuki Honda

01:04.500 --> 01:08.960
Directed by
Rintaro

01:09.840 --> 01:16.060
At this moment our state extends
its reach to the stars!

01:16.260 --> 01:19.560
I tremble at the honour
of announcing...

01:19.850 --> 01:25.690
...the culmination of humanity's
long history of intellect and science.

01:25.940 --> 01:31.490
Our power spans the earth.
Now it will illuminate the stars!

01:31.700 --> 01:36.080
May it stand forever! Our Ziggurat!

03:17.550 --> 03:22.100
Those robots are getting big ideas.
They don't know their place!

03:22.600 --> 03:26.560
But our economy is unthinkable
without robot labour.

03:26.810 --> 03:30.610
Yes, but they cause friction
with human workers.

03:31.070 --> 03:34.110
The enemy is developing new weapons.

03:34.320 --> 03:39.620
What Metropolis needs is a leader
who will be a powerful symbol!

03:55.460 --> 04:00.010
Duke Red, with the Ziggurat complete,
will you be entering politics?

04:00.260 --> 04:02.050
Don't be silly!

04:02.260 --> 04:07.810
As long as President Boone governs,
our state is secure.

04:08.020 --> 04:10.520
Politics has no need of me.

04:10.770 --> 04:14.150
Mr. President, would you like
to see Duke Red in politics?

04:14.480 --> 04:21.030
Don't encourage him! How could I
compete with anyone so popular?

04:23.200 --> 04:28.870
Is it true there are military
facilities in the Ziggurat?

04:29.170 --> 04:31.790
Would the mayor care to comment?

04:32.750 --> 04:37.300
Ask Minister of State Skunk about that.

04:37.510 --> 04:39.840
Hurray for the Ziggurat!

04:40.010 --> 04:42.300
Long live Metropolis!

04:46.020 --> 04:50.060
Uncle Shunsaku,
what does ''Ziggurat'' mean?

04:50.310 --> 04:52.730
Who knows?

04:53.980 --> 04:57.570
-Hey! Look up there!
-What's that?

05:04.910 --> 05:08.750
Malduk! It's the Malduks!

05:22.840 --> 05:24.680
There he is!

06:24.570 --> 06:27.830
You said she'd be ready tonight,
Dr. Laughton.

06:28.030 --> 06:29.450
Er, well....

06:29.660 --> 06:34.830
What is the meaning of this?
I've given you the best facilities...

06:35.080 --> 06:36.330
...money can buy!

06:36.540 --> 06:40.800
If you could wait a little longer,
I'm almost done.

06:41.050 --> 06:45.890
I'm tired of hearing that.
I'll be at your lab tomorrow night.

06:46.090 --> 06:50.600
But it's not the kind of place
you'd go to!

06:50.810 --> 06:53.230
And the place is a mess!

06:53.290 --> 06:55.520
Get back to work!

07:10.700 --> 07:14.540
-It's me.
-I hear there was trouble, Rock.

07:15.290 --> 07:18.540
Yes. A robot agitator in the plaza.

07:18.750 --> 07:21.960
You were supposed
to have that under control!

07:22.170 --> 07:24.130
Yes, Father.

07:24.550 --> 07:28.340
Fool! I am not your father!

07:28.590 --> 07:33.770
I merely found you during
the last war and took you in.

07:33.980 --> 07:35.810
Yes, sir.

07:59.460 --> 08:03.550
I'm Shunsaku Ban,
a private investigator from Japan.

08:03.750 --> 08:08.840
I have a letter of introduction
to Superintendent Notarlin.

08:17.230 --> 08:18.890
I see.

08:19.100 --> 08:23.270
So you're saying this Dr. Laughton...

08:23.480 --> 08:26.360
...is hiding out...

08:26.610 --> 08:30.030
...here in Metropolis?

08:36.950 --> 08:43.290
Yes. This is a reliable tip from
an organ smuggler he dealt with.

08:43.500 --> 08:47.760
The International Human Rights
Committee and other organizations...

08:48.010 --> 08:49.970
...have warrants for him...

08:50.180 --> 08:54.810
...for vivisection experiments
and dealing in human organs.

08:55.140 --> 08:59.440
To which end
I ask for your cooperation...

08:59.640 --> 09:06.070
...seeing I've never been in this city
and I don't know east from west here.

09:06.900 --> 09:12.110
I'd like to help, but with
the celebrations for the Ziggurat...

09:12.320 --> 09:14.200
...going on all week...

09:14.410 --> 09:20.580
...it's taking every single person
I have to keep things under control.

09:21.080 --> 09:23.670
I don't have anybody.

09:23.920 --> 09:28.340
Well, I could give you a robot
if that's okay with you.

09:28.550 --> 09:30.930
A robot?!

09:31.130 --> 09:34.140
Yes. He's very good.

09:34.400 --> 09:38.690
He's not authorized to
arrest people...

09:38.900 --> 09:44.110
<i>...but he can certainly assist you</i>
<i>in your investigation.</i>

09:47.410 --> 09:51.410
Do I have to return him
with a full tank?

09:52.790 --> 09:57.250
He only needs refueling
every five years.

10:02.720 --> 10:06.470
Soon they won't need us anymore.

10:06.720 --> 10:09.760
I'm Kenichi. How do you do?

10:10.060 --> 10:14.140
I am Model 803-D-RP-DM...

10:14.350 --> 10:17.270
...497-3-C.

10:18.310 --> 10:21.280
Uh, how do you do?

10:31.540 --> 10:35.580
<i>The completion of the Ziggurat...</i>

10:35.790 --> 10:39.750
<i>... establishes our Metropolis</i>
<i>as the world leader...</i>

10:39.960 --> 10:43.170
<i>... in industry, economics and culture.</i>

10:43.420 --> 10:50.180
<i>Thus is born a state that</i>
<i>will last a thousand years!</i>

10:50.470 --> 10:53.810
<i>I tremble at the honour</i>
<i>of announcing...</i>

10:54.140 --> 10:59.440
<i>... the culmination of humanity's</i>
<i>long history of intellect and science.</i>

10:59.650 --> 11:05.360
<i>Our power spans the earth.</i>
<i>Now it will illuminate the stars!</i>

11:05.570 --> 11:09.700
<i>May it stand forever! Our Ziggurat!</i>

11:15.540 --> 11:21.420
Well, where do we start,
uh, 803, uh....

11:23.130 --> 11:27.130
D-RP-DM497-3-C.

11:28.300 --> 11:31.010
Don't you have an easier name?

11:31.220 --> 11:35.980
We are not allowed human names,
as it may infringe...

11:36.180 --> 11:38.390
...upon human rights.

11:42.440 --> 11:47.190
I know! As of now, your name is Pero.

11:47.450 --> 11:49.490
That's a dog's name!

11:49.700 --> 11:55.240
That's right. I used to have a dog
named Pero. He was a great dog.

11:56.700 --> 12:00.420
In my opinion,
a criminal could not hide...

12:00.620 --> 12:03.630
...up here in Metropolis.

12:03.840 --> 12:07.420
I have reliable sources
that say he's here!

12:07.670 --> 12:12.220
Dr. Laughton would not hide up here.
He would go to Zone 1.

12:12.470 --> 12:15.220
-Zone 1 ?
-Underground.

12:15.390 --> 12:18.270
Hey! You are a detective!

12:18.810 --> 12:24.480
It is simply a calculation
of probabilities.

12:47.130 --> 12:50.300
Robots are strictly forbidden...

12:51.010 --> 12:53.720
...to operate outside
their assigned area.

12:53.930 --> 13:00.350
That robot was not authorized
to operate at surface level.

13:08.400 --> 13:13.570
Okay, but who are those guys?
They look like fascists.

13:13.780 --> 13:18.950
The Malduk Party, vigilantes
who started as a political group.

13:19.160 --> 13:23.500
Movement between levels is restricted.

13:23.710 --> 13:28.920
No one who carries the mark
may pass through this gate.

13:29.130 --> 13:31.420
So that robot had the mark?

13:31.630 --> 13:35.180
Yes. Each block has a gate like this.

13:35.390 --> 13:40.810
There are, of course, hidden ways
and people who work as guides to them.

13:41.020 --> 13:43.520
Damn right! The system's wrong!

13:48.400 --> 13:53.400
It takes light
to create shadow, I guess.

13:53.740 --> 13:57.200
This level is not
particularly dangerous...

13:57.410 --> 14:03.580
...but there are places in which
police writ does not run. Avoid them.

14:03.830 --> 14:09.210
We can't do that.
We're not here as tourists.

15:08.810 --> 15:10.690
Duke Red.

15:11.730 --> 15:13.650
Let's see it.

15:32.170 --> 15:36.880
Very good. Isn't she finished?

15:37.090 --> 15:42.720
Her final-stage energy processor
isn't stable yet.

15:43.890 --> 15:46.980
Are you using real organs?

15:47.180 --> 15:51.060
Dear me, no! That's illegal!

15:51.270 --> 15:56.110
Real organs are quicker,
but they don't last very long.

15:56.320 --> 15:59.200
Hers are mechanical. I made them.

15:59.530 --> 16:04.120
She will be my masterpiece!

16:08.080 --> 16:09.710
When will you finish?

16:09.920 --> 16:14.000
Within the week.
If I start her too early...

16:14.210 --> 16:19.220
...she'll build up too much energy,
catch fire and explode.

16:22.890 --> 16:25.350
My Tima....

17:05.600 --> 17:08.890
I'm not giving you to anyone!

17:09.100 --> 17:12.650
I'll put on the finishing touches...

17:12.850 --> 17:16.150
...and together we will flee!

17:32.830 --> 17:36.670
Rock? What are you doing here?

17:36.880 --> 17:40.340
Protecting my father is
my most important task.

17:40.550 --> 17:45.470
Father? But Duke Red has no children.

17:45.720 --> 17:48.470
And the child who died was a girl.

17:48.680 --> 17:51.930
Quiet! I know what you're up to.

17:52.600 --> 17:57.730
No mad scientist is going
to deceive my father.

17:58.980 --> 18:04.030
And no mannequin like this
will steal his heart.

18:05.030 --> 18:06.450
Stop!

18:06.780 --> 18:11.200
It is at Duke Red's request
that I've made Tima.

18:11.410 --> 18:14.710
Tima is the super-being
who is to sit...

18:15.120 --> 18:18.670
...on the Throne of Power
atop the Ziggurat.

18:18.920 --> 18:24.720
You lie! He would never give
the Ziggurat to a robot!

18:24.930 --> 18:28.850
Perhaps you should ask
Duke Red about that.

18:29.180 --> 18:35.900
Will you destroy the super-being for
whom the one you call Father waits?

18:39.940 --> 18:44.450
No robot will steal my father!

18:50.370 --> 18:53.500
No! Don't!

19:02.050 --> 19:06.130
<i>O, ye Gods, give me courage...</i>

19:06.340 --> 19:11.760
<i>...and strength to guard</i>
<i>my father from machines!</i>

20:11.910 --> 20:13.950
Fire! Fire!

20:45.190 --> 20:47.990
A Malduk set that fire!

20:48.190 --> 20:50.820
I saw him!

20:51.820 --> 20:55.410
The ones up there want to kill us!

20:56.950 --> 21:02.210
Atlas is right!
They think we're nothing but garbage!

21:02.710 --> 21:06.710
To arms! Now we have to fight!

21:06.960 --> 21:11.720
Please remain calm. Fire-fighting
operations are commencing.

21:13.090 --> 21:16.510
Everyone please step back.

21:16.760 --> 21:18.680
Robots out!

21:20.730 --> 21:25.270
First you take our jobs,
and now you're trying to kill us!

21:25.520 --> 21:28.230
This is no time to be fighting!

21:33.030 --> 21:34.700
What the--?!

22:21.730 --> 22:25.270
But why did he set fire
to that old factory?

22:25.520 --> 22:28.820
Well, that strange old man was around.

22:30.150 --> 22:33.780
An old man? This one?

22:33.990 --> 22:37.330
-Yes.
-Thanks a lot!

22:47.000 --> 22:50.380
There's someone in there!

22:51.010 --> 22:56.140
Oh, no. Kenichi, go round the back.
Hurry!

23:54.740 --> 23:58.200
-Come on, Laughton!
-Notebook....

24:00.950 --> 24:03.660
That notebook?

24:04.710 --> 24:06.580
Laughton!

24:44.710 --> 24:47.460
<i>Laughton's lab burned down?!</i>

24:47.670 --> 24:53.380
<i>I guess he was doing an experiment.</i>
<i>The fire just ripped right through it.</i>

24:53.590 --> 24:58.090
<i>-What happened to him?</i>
<i>-His body was found.</i>

24:59.760 --> 25:02.600
Whatever he was doing...

25:02.810 --> 25:06.190
...considering there are warrants
for his arrest...

25:06.390 --> 25:09.770
...it must have been
something dangerous.

25:10.980 --> 25:14.940
What's wrong, Father?
What did Dr. Laughton mean to you?

25:15.150 --> 25:18.910
Get out! Leave me alone.

27:03.180 --> 27:05.510
Where am I?

27:17.020 --> 27:20.440
That was sure some fire!

27:20.650 --> 27:23.200
Well, it was just an old factory.

27:23.410 --> 27:27.200
Saves the trouble of tearing it down.

27:29.870 --> 27:36.000
<i>This is strange. She was</i>
<i>the most advanced robot there is.</i>

27:36.210 --> 27:38.590
<i>There should be something left.</i>

27:41.590 --> 27:45.090
-Pero, who's that?
-Rock of the Malduks.

27:46.260 --> 27:49.560
He's young,
but he's one of their main men.

27:49.770 --> 27:52.690
They say he does
Duke Red's dirty work.

27:52.890 --> 27:57.690
Duke Red?
ls he connected with the Malduks?

27:57.900 --> 28:00.610
He's the party founder.

28:01.190 --> 28:07.450
Now there's no official connection,
but he funds their activities.

28:08.910 --> 28:12.660
It's a public secret.

28:12.870 --> 28:14.960
Everyone knows.

28:18.920 --> 28:22.590
Where does this sewer come out?

28:22.800 --> 28:26.300
It merges up ahead
with the sewage from Zone 2...

28:26.510 --> 28:29.470
...and goes to
the processing plant in Zone 3.

28:29.720 --> 28:34.770
If she's down there, she'll have
been chopped up with the garbage.

28:34.980 --> 28:36.600
Anyone else, yes.

28:37.060 --> 28:40.770
The criminal always returns
to the scene.

28:41.230 --> 28:44.150
An old saying, but a good one.

28:44.360 --> 28:47.530
We should continue searching
for Kenichi.

29:07.010 --> 29:09.720
Who are you?

29:09.930 --> 29:11.850
Who are you?

29:12.100 --> 29:17.560
No, no, no. You call yourself "I".

29:18.440 --> 29:21.070
"I" am who?

29:22.610 --> 29:25.650
-"I" am....
-You are I.

29:26.150 --> 29:28.570
No, listen.

29:29.070 --> 29:34.160
You are "I". I am "you" ....
Huh?

29:34.660 --> 29:36.160
I am who.

29:36.660 --> 29:42.170
Yeah, that's right.
And I'm Kenichi. Kenichi.

29:42.840 --> 29:45.420
-Kenichi.
-Yeah.

29:46.550 --> 29:50.800
Anyway, it'll all come to you
after a while.

29:51.010 --> 29:56.140
Your name, your family,
your father, your mother.

29:56.350 --> 29:59.140
Family...father....

30:10.990 --> 30:13.870
Uh, thanks, I guess.

30:14.120 --> 30:18.580
I know this is food,
but it's all rotten.

30:18.870 --> 30:20.170
Food....

30:20.370 --> 30:26.050
Yeah. You put it in your mouth
like this and eat it.

30:26.260 --> 30:31.050
No, don't eat that!
It'll make you sick!

30:31.340 --> 30:34.100
No, don't eat. Make you sick.

30:40.520 --> 30:46.110
<i>Attention Control. Cloud cover 1.1.</i>
<i>Clear to proceed with experiment.</i>

30:46.320 --> 30:49.990
<i>Magnetic bias 3.7.</i>
<i>Continuing line adjustment.</i>

30:50.200 --> 30:53.280
<i>Commencing cooling. Opening dome.</i>

30:53.490 --> 30:56.290
<i>40 seconds to radiation.</i>
<i>39, 38....</i>

30:56.490 --> 31:01.790
<i>Motor, cooling, sensor</i>
<i>and operating systems, all go.</i>

31:02.040 --> 31:04.630
<i>Control authorization. We are go.</i>

31:04.840 --> 31:09.130
<i>Energy condensers confirmed</i>
<i>at Level 3, plus-33.</i>

31:09.340 --> 31:10.630
<i>Roger.</i>

31:28.320 --> 31:33.410
<i>Observation Group to Control.</i>
<i>Transmitting footage from city.</i>

31:34.950 --> 31:37.580
<i>Commencing final preparations.</i>

31:37.910 --> 31:40.750
<i>Magnetic target: bias 0.25.</i>

31:42.670 --> 31:45.630
<i>Optical target: bias 1.06.</i>

31:49.630 --> 31:52.260
<i>Radiation equipment in position.</i>

31:54.720 --> 31:57.600
We'll radiate for three minutes.

31:57.810 --> 32:04.600
Citizens won't be affected,
but aboveground robots will.

32:04.810 --> 32:10.400
I'm having everything recorded.
The data will be valuable.

32:11.530 --> 32:14.150
Begin at Level 3.

32:14.360 --> 32:16.320
Yes, doctor.

32:25.830 --> 32:28.000
Commencing radiation!

32:44.140 --> 32:47.350
<i>Terminate Level-3 radiation</i>
<i>at 180 seconds.</i>

32:47.560 --> 32:50.480
<i>Solar constant deviation at minus 24.</i>

32:50.690 --> 32:53.280
<i>Five seconds to Sector R.</i>

32:53.490 --> 32:58.280
<i>4...3...2...1.</i>

32:59.870 --> 33:03.000
<i>Omotanium fusion!</i>

33:03.200 --> 33:07.540
<i>Omotanium confirmed</i>
<i>in Fraunhofer phase.</i>

33:07.750 --> 33:12.000
<i>35,000...40,000...45,000.</i>

33:12.210 --> 33:17.890
<i>Sunspot field density,</i>
<i>800 and rising.</i>

33:18.090 --> 33:21.260
<i>Ionospheric disturbance.</i>
<i>Communications disrupted.</i>

34:33.840 --> 34:39.800
<i>Level-3 radiation terminated.</i>
<i>Control disengaged.</i>

34:41.840 --> 34:44.180
Success!

34:46.220 --> 34:49.560
This will set
the whole world on its ear!

34:49.850 --> 34:55.230
You now hold the power
of the gods themselves.

34:57.650 --> 35:03.820
If only Dr. Laughton had finished
building our guardian deity....

35:09.660 --> 35:12.670
<i>He's caused anomalies in sunspots...</i>

35:12.880 --> 35:16.380
<i>...and bathed Earth</i>
<i>in harmful magnetic radiation.</i>

35:16.590 --> 35:20.670
<i>It's an outrage that he would</i>
<i>endanger national security...</i>

35:20.880 --> 35:22.930
<i>...by developing such a thing!</i>

35:23.220 --> 35:29.310
The Malduk robot hunters are
using this as an excuse...

35:29.520 --> 35:33.900
...to cry "human rights" and press
for changes in the Robot Law.

35:34.230 --> 35:37.150
The pro-robot citizens' groups...

35:37.360 --> 35:41.150
...say that's reactionary nonsense.
They're organizing protests.

35:41.360 --> 35:44.450
There's fighting breaking out.

35:45.620 --> 35:48.200
This is our chance, Mr. President!

35:48.410 --> 35:53.420
We could make a case for treason here.

35:57.040 --> 35:59.510
Will the military support us?

35:59.710 --> 36:05.430
Some units are under Duke Red's
influence, but I can handle that.

36:10.220 --> 36:13.230
We'll stir up the public
with a few leaks.

36:13.440 --> 36:19.690
Once sentiment is against Duke Red,
we'll arrest him for treason.

36:20.860 --> 36:24.490
Should military action be needed,
you have...

36:24.700 --> 36:26.370
...my approval.

36:35.040 --> 36:38.710
I suspect he was the guy
who did in Laughton.

36:38.920 --> 36:42.920
What I don't understand is
how they were connected.

36:43.130 --> 36:47.930
Just what was Laughton
working on, anyway?

36:49.180 --> 36:51.220
What will you do?

36:51.470 --> 36:56.650
Laughton's already dead.
I want, at least, to know why.

36:56.850 --> 36:59.940
My client deserves that.

37:18.000 --> 37:22.460
-Where's he going now?
-Zone 2, I think.

37:22.670 --> 37:27.470
There's another level below this?
How far down does this place go?

37:28.390 --> 37:32.720
Zone 2 is the Metropolis
power plant area.

37:33.060 --> 37:37.440
Zone 3 below that is
the sewage-handling facility.

37:37.770 --> 37:39.520
The sewage facility.

37:39.730 --> 37:45.610
You know, he was looking
at a drain behind that factory.

37:47.780 --> 37:51.950
I'll report back
and get permission to go below.

37:52.160 --> 37:56.870
I'll file a missing persons report
on Kenichi too.

37:57.250 --> 38:01.000
-Hey! You're old for a petty thief!
-Sorry!

38:02.670 --> 38:07.170
If anyone was wandering
around down there...

38:07.380 --> 38:10.010
...they'd notice him right away.

38:12.180 --> 38:14.220
How often are you down here?

38:14.470 --> 38:18.020
Twice a week,
for maintenance on the robots.

38:28.240 --> 38:34.620
These are Albert ll types.
It's their last check this week.

38:54.180 --> 38:56.060
Is anyone here?

39:03.650 --> 39:08.490
You never get used to
the stink down here, though.

39:09.240 --> 39:13.620
No human could last a day
at this work.

39:26.380 --> 39:28.510
-What is it?
-Someone's there.

39:28.710 --> 39:30.380
Impossible!

39:31.380 --> 39:37.100
Hey! What are you doing there?!
This is a restricted area!

39:37.310 --> 39:38.890
So she survived.

39:39.560 --> 39:41.390
Help!

39:42.900 --> 39:47.900
-What are you doing?!
-It's all right. They're criminals.

39:48.150 --> 39:50.400
How do we get out of here?

39:53.610 --> 39:57.910
Stop that, please!
You'll hit the equipment!

40:07.210 --> 40:08.880
Are you okay?

40:25.770 --> 40:28.690
That guy's trying to kill us!

41:06.190 --> 41:08.730
Move! Move! Out of the way!

41:09.770 --> 41:12.070
You piece of junk!

41:13.530 --> 41:15.200
Move!

41:47.690 --> 41:49.770
Is it safe?

42:13.960 --> 42:16.720
It looks okay.

42:29.100 --> 42:31.520
What's wrong?

42:36.530 --> 42:41.030
Oh, I get it.
Fifi can't go through that gate.

42:41.910 --> 42:46.120
Thanks for everything, Fifi.
We'll see you again.

42:47.040 --> 42:48.540
Move!

42:51.750 --> 42:53.170
It's him!

43:16.230 --> 43:17.690
Fifi!

43:25.700 --> 43:29.210
No weapons through here.
May I see your I.D.?

43:29.580 --> 43:31.710
I'm Rock of the Malduks!

43:35.290 --> 43:38.460
<i>Demonstrations are forbidden</i>
<i>during Celebration Week.</i>

43:38.670 --> 43:42.180
<i>Please disperse immediately.</i>

43:43.930 --> 43:45.800
Kenichi?

43:48.430 --> 43:50.600
-Kenichi!
-Hey!

43:52.850 --> 43:54.100
Pay up!

46:12.160 --> 46:15.960
-They're not here!
-They have to be! Keep looking!

46:49.700 --> 46:52.620
Look over that way!

47:21.190 --> 47:24.730
What's the matter, Atlas?
We're waiting for your signal!

47:24.940 --> 47:29.530
Not today. There are Malduks
all over the place.

47:29.740 --> 47:33.870
-Was there a leak?
-They're the reason.

47:35.030 --> 47:39.120
Rock's after them. Come on!

47:39.370 --> 47:43.880
He was at that factory.

47:57.520 --> 47:59.850
Who are you?
Where did you come from?

48:00.060 --> 48:04.100
I'm Kenichi. I'm from Japan.
My uncle's a private....

48:04.310 --> 48:11.070
-A private what?
-A journalist! I'm his assistant.

48:12.150 --> 48:13.990
Why is Rock after you?

48:14.240 --> 48:18.790
I don't know.
He just started shooting at us.

48:18.990 --> 48:22.410
I don't trust them. Let's kill them.

48:22.960 --> 48:27.250
Cool it! We're not a gang.

48:27.460 --> 48:30.210
He says he's a journalist.

48:30.420 --> 48:37.760
If he can tell the world
about Metropolis, that helps us!

48:37.970 --> 48:44.400
We can't waste time on nice uniforms
and our pictures in the paper.

48:45.400 --> 48:47.940
The uniform I die in...

48:49.530 --> 48:52.570
...will be the uniform
of the revolution!

49:32.780 --> 49:34.450
Look at that!

49:34.650 --> 49:36.950
-She looks like an angel!
-Yeah.

49:37.950 --> 49:39.870
An angel.

49:47.040 --> 49:51.460
Around here there's two
or three families to a room.

49:52.590 --> 49:55.760
There are no schools
and hardly any jobs.

49:56.010 --> 50:01.390
They survive on food handouts,
but with the Ziggurat celebrations...

50:01.600 --> 50:03.520
...that's all been stopped.

50:04.730 --> 50:08.230
What does "Ziggurat" mean?

50:09.360 --> 50:12.610
It's an ancient Babylonian tower.

50:12.820 --> 50:18.070
The Tower of Babel was one.
You know what happened to that.

50:18.320 --> 50:22.490
The king's pride brought down
the wrath of God on him.

50:23.830 --> 50:28.460
History repeats itself.
The same thing will happen to Duke Red.

50:28.670 --> 50:33.050
But it won't be God this time.
It'll be us.

50:58.530 --> 51:00.570
Is that wrong?

51:05.660 --> 51:11.630
No, it's fine.
I was just thinking your hair's grown.

51:12.460 --> 51:16.090
What kind of hair do you like?

51:17.970 --> 51:20.590
Yours is fine right now.

51:21.680 --> 51:25.930
Let's get back to your writing.
Next comes....

51:26.140 --> 51:28.180
-Tima.
-What?

51:28.930 --> 51:31.190
Tima. My name.

51:34.570 --> 51:37.690
So you remember!

51:38.400 --> 51:42.700
That's great! Now you'll start
remembering more and more.

51:44.120 --> 51:47.700
Thank you, Kenichi.

51:55.170 --> 51:59.670
Oh, I forgot.
I borrowed this from Atlas.

52:05.760 --> 52:07.520
Kenichi?

52:14.520 --> 52:18.610
So the army's with us?
That helps a lot.

52:18.820 --> 52:21.650
The underground residents
support us...

52:21.860 --> 52:26.330
...but they're not sure
if we've got the strength to win.

52:26.530 --> 52:31.290
The Malduks are to move
when the Ziggurat celebrations end.

52:31.500 --> 52:37.290
We want you to crush them
and storm the Ziggurat.

52:37.500 --> 52:43.970
The president will announce
the arrest of Duke Red for treason.

52:44.180 --> 52:46.800
He will invoke his powers...

52:47.010 --> 52:50.890
...to take control of
the police and military.

52:51.890 --> 52:57.020
Then Metropolis will be governed
by the rule of law.

52:57.570 --> 53:03.030
And we will participate as
a proper political party.

53:07.830 --> 53:14.540
Of course, Atlas. The president
will welcome you with open arms.

53:15.670 --> 53:18.290
The things I get myself into!

53:18.500 --> 53:21.760
I finally find that kid
and look what happens!

53:21.960 --> 53:26.260
I'm sorry I could not have been
of more assistance.

53:26.470 --> 53:28.550
What are you talking about?

53:28.760 --> 53:33.680
You've been lots of help!
I don't know east from west here.

53:33.890 --> 53:38.560
Don't worry about Kenichi.
He's tougher than he--

53:41.980 --> 53:44.490
Cut that out!

53:50.030 --> 53:53.040
Just look at this, will you?

54:33.830 --> 54:39.790
"Watch out. Hide, robots.
Coup d'état."

54:40.000 --> 54:43.090
What?! A coup d'état?

55:11.450 --> 55:13.530
Oh, man!

55:34.310 --> 55:37.430
Take a good look, Kenichi.

55:37.640 --> 55:41.520
Tell the whole world how angry we are.

56:00.460 --> 56:03.170
I'm all out of breath!

56:09.130 --> 56:13.840
We'd better get out of here, Pero.
We can't do anything.

56:14.090 --> 56:16.810
Ask headquarters for backup.

56:16.970 --> 56:20.310
I'm not leaving you here!

56:20.560 --> 56:25.940
It's robots they're going
to attack first!

56:27.150 --> 56:29.690
-I will be fine.
-What?

56:30.360 --> 56:36.530
It is also my duty to ensure the
safety of all visitors to our city.

56:36.740 --> 56:43.080
All right. Just don't stir
anything up till I get back!

56:58.060 --> 57:02.350
Are you going to hold this gate
all by yourself?

57:02.560 --> 57:08.020
Demonstrations are forbidden during
Celebration Week. Please disperse.

57:08.270 --> 57:11.570
Sorry, we can't do that.
Our time has come.

57:11.820 --> 57:17.070
Why must humanity settle matters
by resorting to violence?

57:19.370 --> 57:23.870
Yes, we all know that.
I agree it is a problem.

57:24.080 --> 57:28.000
It's our emotions.
They vibrate, and all we can do...

57:28.210 --> 57:30.800
...is move forward
within that amplitude.

57:31.010 --> 57:34.930
But without affirming them,
we can't survive.

57:59.200 --> 58:02.080
It's time for the uprising to begin.

58:02.330 --> 58:05.370
When should we release a statement?

58:06.210 --> 58:09.170
Things should be clear
by about 1 p.m...

58:09.420 --> 58:12.880
...so I suggest 3 or 3:30.

58:18.590 --> 58:21.390
What is it, minister?

58:22.520 --> 58:24.480
Hard to relax, eh?

58:24.680 --> 58:29.400
Yes, Mr. President.
I have an unpleasant duty to perform.

58:34.280 --> 58:36.490
What the--?!

58:36.740 --> 58:40.820
You've gone over to Duke Red!

58:42.910 --> 58:46.370
I am merely history's agent.

58:50.290 --> 58:54.590
Wait! We can discuss this!

59:47.060 --> 59:48.930
Why?

59:52.060 --> 59:56.650
Why do humans just go
and destroy robots?

01:00:02.740 --> 01:00:04.990
Revolution.

01:00:11.170 --> 01:00:13.330
<i>The coup d'état has failed.</i>

01:00:13.540 --> 01:00:18.460
<i>Martial law is in effect,</i>
<i>under the command of Duke Red.</i>

01:00:18.670 --> 01:00:23.590
<i>Abandon your weapons and surrender.</i>

01:00:23.840 --> 01:00:27.010
<i>I repeat,</i>
<i>the coup d'état has failed.</i>

01:00:27.220 --> 01:00:32.060
<i>Martial law is in effect,</i>
<i>under the command of Duke Red.</i>

01:00:32.270 --> 01:00:37.110
<i>Abandon your weapons and surrender.</i>

01:00:40.240 --> 01:00:42.660
Kenichi!

01:00:42.860 --> 01:00:47.030
Hey! Kenichi!

01:00:51.460 --> 01:00:53.370
Uncle!

01:00:57.090 --> 01:01:00.760
You're safe! That's great!

01:01:00.970 --> 01:01:05.390
-Are you all right?
-This? It's nothing!

01:01:07.640 --> 01:01:09.430
Who's this?

01:01:12.430 --> 01:01:17.900
Her name's Tima.
We escaped from that fire together.

01:01:18.400 --> 01:01:21.610
Tima, this is my uncle.

01:01:22.700 --> 01:01:24.150
Uncle.

01:01:36.750 --> 01:01:38.630
Atlas!

01:01:40.250 --> 01:01:45.300
It was a trap!

01:01:53.350 --> 01:01:55.730
We meet at last.

01:01:56.600 --> 01:01:58.440
Don't move!

01:02:05.450 --> 01:02:07.200
No trouble.

01:02:07.740 --> 01:02:12.660
Give me the girl,
and you might get back home alive.

01:02:12.910 --> 01:02:18.040
Don't make promises
you won't keep, Rock!

01:02:29.140 --> 01:02:31.720
Don't play games with me!

01:02:31.970 --> 01:02:34.270
Tima, pick up the gun!

01:02:57.330 --> 01:03:01.040
I'll have that back, please.

01:03:01.290 --> 01:03:04.960
Don't give it to him!

01:03:18.980 --> 01:03:23.940
You going to shoot?
I'm human, you know.

01:03:27.860 --> 01:03:29.780
Rock!

01:03:45.670 --> 01:03:49.970
So it's these people
you've neglected your duties...

01:03:50.220 --> 01:03:53.140
...to go chasing after--

01:04:06.230 --> 01:04:08.570
Tima!

01:04:09.200 --> 01:04:11.280
It's you!

01:04:12.070 --> 01:04:16.080
Rock! What's going on here?!

01:04:17.240 --> 01:04:23.380
You told me no one survived
the fire in Dr. Laughton's lab!

01:04:23.580 --> 01:04:27.670
And how did you know about Tima?
Answer me!

01:04:35.550 --> 01:04:37.180
I will.

01:04:37.430 --> 01:04:41.940
You are the one who must sit
on the Throne of Power.

01:04:42.810 --> 01:04:47.480
No robot must ever rule
the Ziggurat and Metropolis!

01:04:47.690 --> 01:04:49.440
Fool!

01:04:50.030 --> 01:04:51.700
Robot?

01:04:52.910 --> 01:04:58.200
Do you think you fool me?
You're out of line, boy!

01:04:58.540 --> 01:05:00.500
Get up!

01:05:13.130 --> 01:05:16.760
I never want to see you again!

01:05:16.970 --> 01:05:18.220
Kenichi!

01:05:20.930 --> 01:05:25.900
-So it was you who hired Laughton!
-What if I did?

01:05:26.110 --> 01:05:29.860
I've come from Japan
to arrest Laughton.

01:05:30.070 --> 01:05:34.070
My name is Shunsaku Ban....

01:05:45.670 --> 01:05:48.090
Get in.

01:05:48.290 --> 01:05:51.670
-And Kenichi?
-You'll see him later.

01:06:26.500 --> 01:06:29.420
I'm here to see
Superintendent Notarlin.

01:06:29.630 --> 01:06:34.090
He's been transferred.
His successor hasn't been named.

01:06:34.880 --> 01:06:40.760
There's been a mistake.
The Malduks have taken my nephew away.

01:06:40.970 --> 01:06:44.770
Handle it through your embassy!

01:07:07.160 --> 01:07:12.960
<i>At this moment our state extends</i>
<i>its reach to the stars!</i>

01:07:13.210 --> 01:07:16.920
<i>I tremble at the honour</i>
<i>of announcing...</i>

01:07:17.170 --> 01:07:23.970
<i>... the culmination of humanity's</i>
<i>long history of intellect and science.</i>

01:07:32.900 --> 01:07:34.610
Sake.

01:07:35.440 --> 01:07:36.990
Make it hot.

01:07:37.950 --> 01:07:42.200
Hot whiskey or gin I can do,
for a Japanese detective.

01:07:42.410 --> 01:07:45.870
Hot whiskey, then.

01:07:46.950 --> 01:07:50.790
Who gives a damn about the Ziggurat?!

01:07:51.000 --> 01:07:55.250
And those Malduks can eat dogshit!

01:07:55.460 --> 01:07:57.130
Here.

01:08:01.340 --> 01:08:03.930
Hey! That was Rock!

01:08:04.140 --> 01:08:09.020
I heard he quit the party.
What's he doing here?

01:08:09.390 --> 01:08:12.350
-Thanks.
-Take care.

01:08:21.070 --> 01:08:22.780
Whoops!

01:08:54.310 --> 01:09:00.740
A man earlier tonight asked me
to give you this. I said no.

01:09:00.950 --> 01:09:05.950
He wanted it kept secret
from Duke Red, and of course...

01:09:06.160 --> 01:09:11.750
...I said I couldn't possibly,
but his name was Kenichi.

01:09:14.290 --> 01:09:18.300
"I can't move at the moment...

01:09:18.550 --> 01:09:22.260
...so I can't come to you.

01:09:22.470 --> 01:09:26.430
<i>I'm leaving the country soon.</i>

01:09:26.680 --> 01:09:31.180
<i>I want to see you again. "</i>

01:09:45.160 --> 01:09:47.030
Kenichi!

01:10:01.840 --> 01:10:05.010
What's going on here?

01:10:05.260 --> 01:10:08.550
You will bring her back soon,
won't you?

01:10:08.760 --> 01:10:12.810
I'll be in real trouble
if they ever find out.

01:10:13.100 --> 01:10:16.850
Don't worry. This won't take long.

01:10:18.650 --> 01:10:23.320
This wasn't my idea.
I have to get back.

01:10:25.280 --> 01:10:27.360
You tricked me.

01:10:28.870 --> 01:10:32.950
How else could I talk to you?

01:10:33.200 --> 01:10:38.330
Where's Kenichi?
If you know, take me to him.

01:10:41.340 --> 01:10:44.170
Well, well, well.

01:10:45.760 --> 01:10:50.640
To talk to you,
you'd never guess you were a robot.

01:10:57.020 --> 01:11:01.770
I guess Father chose
his mad scientist very well.

01:11:02.230 --> 01:11:06.900
-What are you talking about?
-You being a robot.

01:11:07.110 --> 01:11:10.530
That's not true. I'm not a robot.

01:11:11.080 --> 01:11:14.120
So what are you? Human?

01:11:18.000 --> 01:11:21.130
So who's your father? Where is he?

01:11:21.670 --> 01:11:23.590
My father...

01:11:24.210 --> 01:11:26.130
...is Kenichi.

01:11:44.190 --> 01:11:48.610
The super-being?
A mannequin like you?!

01:11:55.950 --> 01:11:59.330
<i>If you can't take me</i>
<i>to Kenichi, I'm going.</i>

01:12:11.840 --> 01:12:13.930
Tima's gone?!

01:12:23.980 --> 01:12:27.610
Watch where you're going!

01:13:16.620 --> 01:13:22.210
Let's see inside this super-being that
Father wants so much.

01:13:55.240 --> 01:13:57.530
<i>Come on, Laughton!</i>

01:13:57.780 --> 01:14:00.410
<i>Notebook.</i>

01:14:02.410 --> 01:14:04.210
<i>That notebook?</i>

01:15:25.700 --> 01:15:31.500
Don't be alarmed. I taught Rock
a lesson he won't forget.

01:15:31.710 --> 01:15:33.340
Where's Kenichi?

01:15:33.550 --> 01:15:38.930
I'm looking for him too.
I need your help for that.

01:15:39.130 --> 01:15:40.390
You do?

01:15:40.590 --> 01:15:44.970
I think they've got him
somewhere in the Ziggurat.

01:15:45.180 --> 01:15:51.730
I need to look for him
on the Ziggurat's data network.

01:15:51.940 --> 01:15:54.480
Can you do that?

01:16:14.750 --> 01:16:18.050
Hold out your hand.

01:17:13.480 --> 01:17:15.230
Kenichi!

01:17:26.200 --> 01:17:27.580
Well?

01:17:27.830 --> 01:17:31.710
Kenichi's in that building!

01:17:31.910 --> 01:17:35.330
You did it! I knew he was there!

01:17:37.550 --> 01:17:39.840
<i>What happened to me?</i>

01:17:40.630 --> 01:17:45.260
I see. You don't know
who you are, do you?

01:17:45.470 --> 01:17:47.930
What do you mean?

01:17:53.850 --> 01:17:57.360
I'll report the instant
we find anything, sir.

01:17:57.610 --> 01:18:00.650
-Duke Red?
-Yeah.

01:18:01.320 --> 01:18:04.360
-Anything?
-We can track the signal...

01:18:05.070 --> 01:18:08.370
...by where it burned out
the splitters.

01:18:12.830 --> 01:18:15.170
-Got it!
-Where?

01:18:15.370 --> 01:18:18.840
Zone 1 , South Block 17.
The Hotel Coconut.

01:18:23.340 --> 01:18:28.350
Tell me, please!
Am I human or am I...?

01:18:28.550 --> 01:18:34.690
Well, you're different
from normal robots.

01:18:34.890 --> 01:18:39.900
I'm human. Just like Kenichi!

01:18:40.110 --> 01:18:43.400
Uh, yes, of course you are!

01:18:44.280 --> 01:18:48.820
<i>Anyway, now we've got</i>
<i>to rescue Kenichi.</i>

01:19:19.940 --> 01:19:22.820
Tima! I've been looking for you!

01:19:35.870 --> 01:19:41.000
Tell me what's going on
or I'll charge you with kidnapping!

01:19:41.500 --> 01:19:47.050
I'm not your man.
It's your son you want to talk to.

01:19:47.300 --> 01:19:49.050
Rock?

01:19:49.340 --> 01:19:51.850
I don't know what the plan is...

01:19:52.050 --> 01:19:58.060
...but I suspect Dr. Laughton
was involved in it somehow.

01:19:58.270 --> 01:20:02.060
And I suspect you had him killed...

01:20:02.690 --> 01:20:05.400
...to keep her a secret.

01:20:10.870 --> 01:20:13.080
Take him away.

01:20:15.660 --> 01:20:17.450
Come on!

01:20:46.480 --> 01:20:50.400
That is a special throne
made especially for you.

01:20:50.610 --> 01:20:54.580
One day from here,
you will rule the entire world!

01:20:54.870 --> 01:20:58.370
Me? Why?

01:20:58.580 --> 01:21:03.750
That is your destiny.
I'll show you.

01:21:14.890 --> 01:21:16.140
Kenichi!

01:21:16.350 --> 01:21:17.930
Kenichi!

01:21:24.310 --> 01:21:29.820
Wake up, Kenichi!
It's me! Can you hear me?

01:21:30.320 --> 01:21:34.200
Kenichi. Kenichi?

01:21:34.820 --> 01:21:37.450
What have you done to him?!

01:21:37.660 --> 01:21:43.830
He's in no danger. We just had
to quiet him down a little.

01:21:45.080 --> 01:21:47.670
Kenichi? Kenichi?

01:21:48.340 --> 01:21:53.800
I'll file a protest with my embassy!
It'll be an international incident!

01:21:54.010 --> 01:21:59.770
Oh? I didn't realize
you were so politically important.

01:21:59.970 --> 01:22:02.350
My apologies.

01:22:02.690 --> 01:22:09.020
But soon every nation in the world
will bow down before Tima.

01:22:10.280 --> 01:22:13.820
Make Kenichi the way he was.

01:22:14.070 --> 01:22:18.330
What's one or two young kids, Tima?

01:22:18.530 --> 01:22:23.120
You have the power to rule the world!

01:22:23.330 --> 01:22:28.380
What power is that? Am I human?

01:22:29.710 --> 01:22:33.590
Or am I one of those poor robots?

01:22:33.800 --> 01:22:40.350
Oh, don't be silly! You're nothing
like those piles of junk!

01:22:40.560 --> 01:22:44.390
Then am I human, like Kenichi?

01:22:45.980 --> 01:22:49.980
What are you saying?!
You're no mere human being...

01:22:50.190 --> 01:22:55.740
...ruled by emotion and feeling,
torn between morality and love!

01:22:59.200 --> 01:23:01.290
You are the super-being!

01:23:02.370 --> 01:23:04.960
So then I am a....

01:23:05.210 --> 01:23:09.250
I've brought you
new clothes, Miss Tima.

01:23:09.460 --> 01:23:12.210
Yes, you are a robot...

01:23:12.460 --> 01:23:16.760
...but you stand at
the pinnacle of all existence!

01:23:23.100 --> 01:23:27.480
No. I have the emotions
and love that you hate.

01:23:27.690 --> 01:23:33.530
That's because your full capacities
haven't yet taken form.

01:23:33.730 --> 01:23:39.280
As your abilities evolve, they're
taking the form of emotion and love.

01:23:39.490 --> 01:23:40.820
In time--

01:23:41.030 --> 01:23:47.580
You will become one with that throne,
a computer weapon meant on conquest!

01:23:48.540 --> 01:23:53.550
Your memories and emotions
will all be erased!

01:23:53.800 --> 01:23:57.090
How did you know that?!

01:23:57.340 --> 01:24:00.390
I fancy myself a detective.

01:24:05.850 --> 01:24:10.400
Come, Miss Tima. You should change.

01:24:12.190 --> 01:24:15.860
Father, open your eyes!

01:24:20.320 --> 01:24:22.070
Rock!

01:24:22.780 --> 01:24:25.200
What on earth?!

01:24:25.950 --> 01:24:28.120
What are you doing?

01:24:31.960 --> 01:24:35.630
It is you who must sit on that throne.

01:24:37.210 --> 01:24:40.630
You are the leader we must bow to!

01:24:44.930 --> 01:24:46.890
No!

01:25:14.000 --> 01:25:15.670
Tima!

01:25:27.470 --> 01:25:29.390
You're awake?

01:25:54.880 --> 01:26:01.050
I am a humanoid, a machine
made to destroy the world.

01:26:02.880 --> 01:26:07.260
-Not destroy! Make again!
-Stop!

01:26:11.730 --> 01:26:13.640
Kenichi....

01:27:12.540 --> 01:27:16.460
Hey! Who threw that switch?
It just started up!

01:27:16.670 --> 01:27:19.710
-Cut the power!
-It won't respond!

01:27:19.920 --> 01:27:23.090
It's going into the red!

01:27:38.600 --> 01:27:40.480
Dr. Ponkotz!

01:27:41.070 --> 01:27:43.150
What's that alarm?

01:27:43.360 --> 01:27:46.990
The omotanium generator's going wild!

01:27:47.200 --> 01:27:50.620
-What's going on?
-I'm not sure.

01:28:32.870 --> 01:28:35.950
Stop, Tima!
You'll destroy the Ziggurat!

01:28:39.120 --> 01:28:42.960
This comes of trifling with robots.

01:28:46.340 --> 01:28:52.140
Her memory's merging with
the data network. She'll go mad!

01:28:52.470 --> 01:28:56.350
Thus God destroyed the Tower of Babel.

01:28:56.560 --> 01:28:58.390
Tima!

01:28:59.310 --> 01:29:02.900
No! She's no longer the Tima you knew!

01:29:14.160 --> 01:29:15.830
All right.

01:29:16.040 --> 01:29:21.790
The omotanium generator will explode
if we don't shut it down!

01:29:27.760 --> 01:29:33.800
The chance of human survival will fall
to 30 percent within one hour.

01:29:34.010 --> 01:29:37.060
My entire worldwide
network of forces...

01:29:37.260 --> 01:29:41.560
...will be completely activated
within 30 minutes.

01:29:42.520 --> 01:29:48.820
<i>Their targets are the world's major</i>
<i>cities and 7 586 other facilities.</i>

01:29:50.900 --> 01:29:53.820
Estimated time period...

01:29:54.030 --> 01:29:58.080
...for eradication of humanity
by biological warfare:

01:29:58.330 --> 01:30:00.830
17 hours, 27 minutes.

01:30:02.830 --> 01:30:05.540
Hear that, Duke Red?

01:30:07.550 --> 01:30:11.840
Your super-being says
she doesn't need us!

01:30:12.050 --> 01:30:15.930
Tima! Come back!

01:30:18.640 --> 01:30:20.770
Kenichi!

01:30:33.450 --> 01:30:34.910
Kenichi!

01:30:58.930 --> 01:31:00.310
Tima!

01:32:22.140 --> 01:32:23.600
Tima!

01:32:50.580 --> 01:32:54.880
<i>Doctor, we've lost control</i>
<i>of the underground power pl--</i>

01:32:55.420 --> 01:32:57.380
What's happening?

01:33:17.990 --> 01:33:22.410
Get out! You robots are
not supposed to be here!

01:33:27.950 --> 01:33:30.960
Tima! It's me!

01:33:39.970 --> 01:33:44.090
Kenichi! It's Kenichi!

01:34:21.050 --> 01:34:22.840
Stop!

01:34:25.180 --> 01:34:27.350
The likes of you...

01:34:28.100 --> 01:34:31.020
...will never kill...

01:34:32.270 --> 01:34:34.600
...my father!

01:34:36.560 --> 01:34:38.190
Rock!

01:36:35.720 --> 01:36:37.520
Tima!

01:36:50.910 --> 01:36:52.700
Tima!

01:37:33.160 --> 01:37:36.200
Tima! Grab my hand!

01:37:36.790 --> 01:37:41.460
<i>-I'm Kenichi. Who are you?</i>
<i>-Who are you?</i>

01:37:41.670 --> 01:37:46.500
<i>No, no, no. You call yourself "I".</i>

01:37:46.750 --> 01:37:48.210
Kenichi!

01:37:49.760 --> 01:37:51.380
Grab on!

01:37:52.050 --> 01:37:54.430
I am who?

01:38:02.020 --> 01:38:05.060
Tima!

01:39:52.920 --> 01:39:56.590
Where did you find this?

01:40:11.400 --> 01:40:13.070
Fifi?

01:40:15.440 --> 01:40:17.240
Fifi!

01:40:55.230 --> 01:40:57.740
Kenichi!

01:40:59.530 --> 01:41:01.700
Uncle!

01:41:19.510 --> 01:41:21.050
Uncle...

01:41:22.050 --> 01:41:25.640
...I think I'd like
to stay here a bit longer.

01:42:39.170 --> 01:42:42.090
<i>I am who?</i>
